  "description": "Web seed server for SpawnDev.WebTorrent. Serves torrent pieces over HTTP range requests (BEP 17/19). Tracker functionality moved to SpawnDev.RTC.Server in 3.1.0 - consumers wire both with `app.UseRtcSignaling(\"/announce\")` + the web seed extension from this package. No HuggingFace dependency - use SpawnDev.WebTorrent.Server.HuggingFace for AI model proxy.",
